@@ -0,0 +1,331 @@
+/*-
+ * ---license-start
+ * Installr Deployer Interface for keycloak-config-cli
+ * ---
+ * Copyright (C) 2025 Installr.io - maintained by Dorian Vallant (dorian@installr.io)
